ou see a  showrunner whose folks who work for them  are happy that means he's doing  something right he is the fearless  leader who has compassion and kindness  and grace so when I first heard he was  doing Star Wars my first one I'm an  actor so I think of myself uh you know  can I be in it what's in it for me and  so I did mention it to JJ and he said  that'd be interesting it might be  something interesting there but I  haven't gotten the call and that is okay  I still adore him and I love what he  does and I think he is the perfect  person to take over that franchise and  we'll make it work and make it exciting  and do something different no we have to  stir the pot and when you're doing  something that's been done so many times  before you want to have someone who has  new ideas and can enhance and and do  something new with what we've already  seen is a real talent and I mean it's  great to see him mixing up things as you  say and bringing in new young people  like brilliant British actor called John  boyega you know Adam driver call some  girls and Andy Serkis is in there as  well as well as the people who we know  from that world originally like Harrison  Ford and Carrie Fisher - I think it's  brilliant the way he's mixed it up I  really loved that I just missed him in  Dubai I was there for signing and he was  there looking for locations then I had  just missed him in London and I loved  that he was seeing actors from all over  the world because this is where our  world is coming we're a melting pot of  people who understand each other from  across the sea and otherwise and I think  it's brilliant of him to be targeting a  world market with his creativity he so  deserves to be successful now you said  that you would have loved to been in  episode 7 but there's still two more to  come as episode 8 and 9 as well so would  you like to be in Star Wars and if you  could be installed was what kind of  character would you like to be well I'd  like to play a leader you know I would  really like to play a leader who knows  what he's doing but has some  vulnerability underneath it so yeah I  put it out there that  you know the eight and nine would be  absolutely wonderful for me to be and I  know there was a military officer in  seven probably a smaller part but I'm  ready for the big huge ones and I would  only want to work with JJ in in that  regard so hey JJ I'm here still and I  love you and of course there's also Star  Trek which the third one JJ is not  directing but Roberto Orci who's the  writer of the other ones is would you be  up for a role in Star Trek yeah you know  I like the sci-fi world it's a world  that is now coming into its own although  it's being recreated all over again and  I think it's important to have some very  very good actors who can deal with the  technological advances that we have in  film many times you're acting with  nobody there and years ago I did a film  with Francis Ford Coppola was called  Cotton Club and you know we acted with  green screen and there was no furniture  we had to just sort of you know it's  really that pantomime play of the  children play and that is so reminiscent  of what we do in movies today and I love  the technology of film and I'd love to  be involved in something like that again  what would you like to say to the fans  out there of yours that are watching  this video right now you know I really  like to say thank you for supporting me  you know I come to these Comic Cons  because I think that the fans who are so  loyal to me I'd love to be able to give  them something a piece of myself back to  them and and so all those Breaking Bad  fans who expect me to be like that all  the time they're always surprised when  they see this great smile I want to let  them know who I am and how much I love  them for supporting me and I love what I  do so I believe that what you think  grows what you think in here grows and  it grows in a way that if you do  something every day if you do something  today to determine your tomorrow it'll  come true because that's what dreams are  dreams are thoughts that are worked on  and put into the universe and practiced  and believed in and then they can come  true  and I certainly have had my dream come  true because I don't work a day in my  life because I love what I do  beautiful points finish on thank you so  much for speaking to us today  pleasure Jan thank you for having me
 

